<title>NORWAY: Norway jobless rate falls to 3.9 pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>Norway jobless rate falls to 3.9 pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	SEPT 1996    AUG 1996   SEPT 1995</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	   3.9	    4.5	  4.5</p>
<p> Unemployed			 84,586	 97,900     95,975</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED FIGURES</p>
<p> Unemployed			  N/A	   90,100     102,307</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
